# Guitar Freaks 2nd Mix Ver 1.01 (GQ883 VER. JAD), Konami 1999: first power-on from blank NVRAM, no
# inputs. The 573 BIOS boots the CD (the flash is blank), which asks "DO YOU WANT TO INITIALIZE
# FLASH-ROM?" by frame ~1200. Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames, to
# compare with MAME.
game gtrfrk2m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

from 0 every 60 snap
at 3000 quit
